      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "해냈어요, 단장님!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "やりました、団長殿！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 3,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "정말… 저를 여기까지 이끌어 주시느라…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私を…ここまで導いてくださって…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 4,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "고생 많으셨습니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "お疲れ様でした！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_TOUCH",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "사람들에게도 그렇지만, 단장님에게도 멋있는 모습을 보여드리고 싶었는데…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "他の人たちにもそうですが、団長殿にも格好いい姿をお見せしたかったのに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "멋진 표정을 지어 보이고 싶은데…!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "凛々しい表情を見せたいのに…！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "왠지 또 눈물이-!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "なぜだか、また涙がー！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "멋진 기사단장이 되려면 아직도 더 성장해야 할 것 같아요…!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "格好いい騎士団長になるには、もっと成長しなければなりませんね…！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "으흡! 흡!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふっ！はっ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_TOUCH",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "후아… 긴장이 풀리니까 왠지…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふぅ…緊張が解けたせいでしょうか…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…배고프지 않으세요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…お腹すきませんか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "오늘은 제가 사드릴 테니! 같이 식사라도 하러 가시죠!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今日は私持ちということで！一緒に食事はどうですか！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나는 잠시 그녀의 환한 얼굴을 바라보았다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私は、しばらく彼女の眩しい笑顔を見つめていた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "수많은 시련과 상처를 딛고 마침내 <color=#F7BE45>[여정]</color>의 끝에 도달한 자.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "幾多の試練と痛みを克服し、ついに<color=#F7BE45>「救援の旅」</color>の終わりに到達した者。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그녀의 앞에는 더욱 많은 고난과 어려움이 기다리고 있을 것이다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "彼女には、更なる苦悩と困難が待ち受けているはずだ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하지만 나는 믿는다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "しかし、私は信じよう。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_10",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그녀는 분명 나를 뛰어넘을…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "彼女ならきっと、私を超える…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
